  "question": {
    "text": "Let the area of the region \\(\\left\\{(x, y): 2 y \\leq x^2+3, y+|x| \\leq 3, y \\geqslant|x-1|\\right\\}\\) be A. Then 6 A is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "LQrsb",
      "text": "16",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Lc38V",
      "text": "12",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EqpwO",
      "text": "14",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "0m0bU",
      "text": "18",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7ed71LgKutJLV2SYLkCvYGtnO6nT8P9_Xj7RDULELJo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n$A \\Rightarrow$ Rectangle ABDE - Area of region EDC\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& A \\Rightarrow 4-2 \\int_0^1(3-x)-\\left(\\frac{x^2+3}{2}\\right) d x \\\\\n& A \\Rightarrow 4-2\\left\\{3 x-\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{x^3}{6}-\\frac{3}{2} x\\right\\}_0^1 \\\\\n& A \\Rightarrow 4-2\\left\\{3-\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{3}{2}\\right\\}=\\frac{7}{3}\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nSo $6 \\mathrm{~A}=14$",
    "image": null
  },
